  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FA-Youth Focused Development, Swaziland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth will be taught and sensitized on key community issues such as gender based violence (GBV), HIV and STIs, drug abuse and human and sexual trafficking. Further, and through the community action initiatives, groups who chose to do so will address and sensitize local communities on above-mentioned issues.</narrative>
  </description>
